<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>Heaven Knows I'm Miserable Now - 2011 Remaster</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">The Smiths</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">Louder Than Bombs</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">1H5N26VqHR4JhuaRKY2I0u</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:17.650" end="00:22.120">I was happy in the haze of a drunken hour</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:22.120" end="00:25.770">But heaven knows I'm miserable now</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:25.770" end="00:30.110">I was looking for a job and then I found a job</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:30.110" end="00:34.830">And heaven knows I'm miserable now</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:34.830" end="00:42.830">In my life, why do I give valuable time</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:43.120" end="00:51.120">To people who don't care if I live or die?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:51.700" end="00:59.630" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:59.630" end="01:04.110">Two lovers entwined pass me by</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:04.110" end="01:08.140">And heaven knows I'm miserable now</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:08.140" end="01:12.480">I was looking for a job and then I found a job</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:12.480" end="01:17.000">And heaven knows I'm miserable now</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:17.000" end="01:24.980">In my life, oh, why do I give valuable time</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:24.980" end="01:32.980">To people who don't care If I live or die?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:33.850" end="01:41.850" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:50.380" end="01:54.850">What she asked of me at the end of the day</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:54.850" end="01:58.740">Caligula would have blushed</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:58.740" end="02:02.590">"Oh, you've been in the house too long", she said</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:02.590" end="02:07.540">And I naturally fled</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:07.540" end="02:15.540">In my life, why do I smile</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:15.810" end="02:23.810">At people who I'd much rather kick in the eye?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:24.370" end="02:32.370" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:32.590" end="02:36.550">I was happy in the haze of a drunken hour</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:36.550" end="02:40.720">But heaven knows I'm miserable now</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:40.720" end="02:44.620">"Oh, you've been in the house too long", she said</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:44.620" end="02:49.740">And I naturally fled</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:49.740" end="02:57.740">In my life, oh, why do I give valuable time</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:57.780" end="03:04.160">To people who don't care If I live or die?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:04.160" end="03:08.160" /></div></body></tt>